elee8zr@rosie.uh.edu (Rit, Vincent) writes:

>I hit a polymorph trap and keep on polymorphing into low HP monsters.
>How could I soon get rid of that curse?
>Praying seems useless, and I can't wait till I find a ring of polymorph
>control.

If you KEEP polymorphing then you are wearing a ring of polymorph. Take
it off (or is it cursed). A polymorph trap only works once on you, and
they are a pretty rare type of trap.
To return to human form, get yourself killed in your polymorphed form
(can be accomplished if no monsters are present by kicking walls).

